// CONTRACT BEAT (owned by mid): hands over hmSurf and the goldTooth (for
// Warden Holt's hmStrength). The first visit only; later visits and the
// contest are in lore/mid/wildmoor.lute and lore/mid/bug-contest.lute.

## The gates

::bg{location="wildmoor-preserve" time="day"}
::music{action="change" mood="calm" volume="normal"}
@narrator: The Wildmoor Preserve: tall grass to the horizon, ponds like dropped coins, and old oaks full of bugs. A ranger at the gate waves you through with a net.
@wildmoorRanger: First time? Stay on the paths, don't feed the Hornbeetles, and if you see the Warden's gold tooth, it's at the rest house. He's been looking for it for a month.
@narrator{when="@midContestOpen"}: Outside the rest house the bug-catching contest is starting. You can hear the nets from here.

## The rest house

::bg{location="wildmoor-rest-house" time="day"}
@narrator: At the far end of the Preserve, past the tall grass and the ponds, a rest house. On the table: a disc, a teapot, and a gold tooth in a saucer.
@wildmoorRanger: The disc's Surf. Belonged to the last Warden, who swam the whole lake every morning. Take it; Kessler's badge will let you use it. The tooth's Holt's. Take that to him, please, before he whistles at me again.
::use{component="obtain" item="hmSurf"}
::use{component="obtain" item="goldTooth"}
